# Ajani's Anguish: "When this enchantment enters, it deals X damage to any target." Bot2 answers the trigger by destroying the
# enchantment with Disenchant. The ability is independent of its source (CR 113.7a) and the damage is dealt by the enchantment as
# it last existed (CR 608.2h), with the X it was cast with: Bot2 still takes 2 and goes to 18. The trample it gave is gone with
# it: Bot1's Ornithopter has only flying again. The positive control for the trample is the neighbouring scenario at X = 0.

